  (text "NEW for the Commander: USB 3.2 Gen 1 hub (Microchip USB5744) on the RK3566 USB3 HOST1 port.\nReplaces the single Type-C USB3 port of the Radxa ZERO 3E (CH482D mux + ET7301B, sheet 14).\nRuns from its internal ROM defaults: no SPI flash, no SMBus pull-ups, all ports removable, no battery charging." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 25.4 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left top)) (uuid "61d76f15-f84d-54c1-aeb0-62239c11ea22"))
